  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LLF - Health System Strengthening with Emphasis on Maternal, Newborn and Child Health Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the project is to contribute towards strengthening the health system to meet the health care of the population. The specific objectives of the project are: (i) Improve access to quality health services particularly to mothers and children and (ii) Strengthen the institutional and human resource capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
